WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A triangle has three sides and three interior angles. Its interior angles always add to 180°.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Add the two known angles and subtract the sum from 180°. For 50° and 60°, the third is 180 − 110 = 70°.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
A right triangle has a 90° angle, so its two other angles add to 90°.
